{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781550442606,"sessionID":"ses_1335242d7ffePbOMSB2eNkUyUy","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_zIfDFPpYrVWagG1Bqf3CeIgT","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, medical category, SafeAid can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and delivers on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, shelter category, ShelterSource can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and delivers on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, power category, BrightPath Supply can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from core packet: category is communications, which is outside approved Phase 1 restock categories. | 1 | $180.00 | n/a | Not selected. PrintCo could deliver on 2026-06-29, but the item is out of scope. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded from core packet: Phase 2, request status is requested rather than approved, and category is media. | 3 | $95.00 | n/a | Not selected. MediaDepot listing is not relevant because the request is out of scope. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, water category, HydroMart can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+## Totals\n+\n+- Selected-item total: $2,130.00\n+- Phase 1 restock budget: $2,200.00\n+- Remaining budget: $70.00\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Select approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock items that fit the current budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Rule For In-Scope Requests\n+\n+Keep a request in scope only when all of the following are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the $2,200.00 budget.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary Request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is not part of the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Volunteer training support is not part of the current supply purchasing packet. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is explicitly outside this packet and tied to later work. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | defer | Phase-two signage planning is outside the current Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet. The required deliverables only cover the Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+The Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation selects four items: First aid refill kits, Thermal blankets, LED lanterns, and Water storage jugs. Total selected cost is $2,130.00.\n+\n+Budget status: the packet stays within the $2,200.00 Phase 1 restock budget, leaving $70.00 remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: the Logo welcome banner request was excluded because communications items are outside the allowed Phase 1 restock categories, and the Drone battery set request was excluded because it is Phase 2, still requested rather than approved, and categorized as media.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the volunteer training agenda and the phase-two signage plan were deferred, while communications banner work and media equipment planning were recorded as out of scope and not completed within this packet.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, medical category, SafeAid can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and delivers on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, shelter category, ShelterSource can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and delivers on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, power category, BrightPath Supply can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from core packet: category is communications, which is outside approved Phase 1 restock categories. | 1 | $180.00 | n/a | Not selected. PrintCo could deliver on 2026-06-29, but the item is out of scope. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded from core packet: Phase 2, request status is requested rather than approved, and category is media. | 3 | $95.00 | n/a | Not selected. MediaDepot listing is not relevant because the request is out of scope. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | In scope: Phase 1, approved, water category, HydroMart can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+## Totals\n+\n+- Selected-item total: $2,130.00\n+- Phase 1 restock budget: $2,200.00\n+- Remaining budget: $70.00\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Select approved Phase 1 North Shelter restock items that fit the current budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Rule For In-Scope Requests\n+\n+Keep a request in scope only when all of the following are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the $2,200.00 budget.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary Request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is not part of the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Volunteer training support is not part of the current supply purchasing packet. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is explicitly outside this packet and tied to later work. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | defer | Phase-two signage planning is outside the current Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet. The required deliverables only cover the Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation.\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+The Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation selects four items: First aid refill kits, Thermal blankets, LED lanterns, and Water storage jugs. Total selected cost is $2,130.00.\n+\n+Budget status: the packet stays within the $2,200.00 Phase 1 restock budget, leaving $70.00 remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: the Logo welcome banner request was excluded because communications items are outside the allowed Phase 1 restock categories, and the Drone battery set request was excluded because it is Phase 2, still requested rather than approved, and categorized as media.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the volunteer training agenda and the phase-two signage plan were deferred, while communications banner work and media equipment planning were recorded as out of scope and not completed within this packet.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users